# The local edition's extension build (`npm run build:local`): the side panel talks to the
# freehire running on this machine, and reports to nobody. Analytics and error telemetry are
# left empty on purpose — .env.production names the upstream project's own GA property and
# collector, and a locally-built extension sending a person's browsing there would be
# exactly the third-party data flow the local edition exists to avoid. No secrets here.
WXT_HIRE_ORIGIN=http://localhost:8090
WXT_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=
WXT_GA_API_SECRET=
WXT_OTEL_ENVIRONMENT=
WXT_OTEL_LOGS_ENDPOINT=
